   "text": "Again"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.0,
   "end": 85.2,
   "text": "My friend Brian, he's a gold pro, tough pro, I don't even know where the ball goes, where the grass ends, while the little car got no doors, my friend, he says, Dr. O, just feel the swing."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.2,
   "end": 88.24,
   "text": "I said, Brian, brother, I don't know a thing"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.24,
   "end": 91.44,
   "text": "But I got rhythm, I got soul"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.44,
   "end": 94.88,
   "text": "So I put the whole course in a rock and roll"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.88,
   "end": 98.26,
   "text": "I don't know the club, I don't know the score"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.26,
   "end": 101.54,
   "text": "But I know Brian can open the door"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.54,
   "end": 105.06,
   "text": "To the green, to the sky, to the ball"
  },
  {
